  },
  {
    "id": 3801001030360,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "そうなったら一緒にＢ小町の曲をやるのは鉄板だよね～\r\n当時のママの衣装と私の衣装を交換！　とかもあり？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/380100103/3801001030360"
  },
  {
    "id": 3801001030370,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "MEMちょ、ファンだって言ってたし、\r\n本物のママ見たらテンパっちゃってたかも！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/380100103/3801001030370"
  },
  {
    "id": 3801001030380,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "先輩は──どうだろ、いつも通りかなぁ……\r\nママのパフォーマンス見て逆にやる気とか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/380100103/3801001030380"
  },
  {
    "id": 3801001030390,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "生半可なものじゃこっちが霞む～みたいな\r\nありそー……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "ruby",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/380100103/3801001030390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3801001030400,
    "speaker": "ルビー",
    "text": "ママが一番輝いちゃうのは自然の摂理だから\r\n諦めてって感じだけど！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
